[00:00.49]No one at this bar knows
[00:00.49] 酒吧里无人知晓
[00:03.42]That we've been going through some things
[00:03.42] 我们正经历艰难时光
[00:06.97]Fallout tonight then work it out tomorrow
[00:06.97] 今夜爆发冲突 明日再化解
